ermine changes

a change is a file here ending .md:

    ---
    graph: minor
    places: patch
    ---
    what changed

levels: patch, minor, major. a prerelease (0.0.0-arctic-hare.3) counts its last number up
whatever the level. a package whose new version leaves ^old takes its importers along at patch.

    deno task changes           the next versions
    deno task changes version   writes them, adds to each CHANGELOG.md, removes the files

after core passes on main (.github/workflows/changes.yml): while there are changes, a release
pull request; when there are none, deno publish.
